This folder is for Papers that were the foundation for the Concord.
Originaly written as stand alone hypothesis, these were combined into a stack which became the core of the Concord main book.


"Unified paths of light" , now renamed for the second edition. Is a comparitive study of the world 8 largest religions in order to extract and distil the civilisation ethics kernal (Blaineys laws) 
that were used as the constitutional moral core of the Concord.
While the source material is theological, the resulting use of the derived ethics is not. 
The methodology of teh first edition was somewhat flawed and much data created during its writign was lost. the second edition is presented here in order to show full methodology and data.
The resultant Blaineys laws slightly differ from the first edition. It is not know if this is result of different set of 8 religions used, or an artifact of the better methodology. TBD.
